WEBVTT

00:00:00.002 --> 00:00:03.302
The first time at her place… never do these three things.

00:00:03.352 --> 00:00:05.476
Almost every man does the second one.

00:00:05.526 --> 00:00:09.590
One: never arrive empty-handed. Flowers for her, not a bottle for you.

00:00:09.640 --> 00:00:11.353
Two: never talk about your ex.

00:00:11.403 --> 00:00:14.997
The first time at Colette’s, I talked about my ex all evening.

00:00:15.047 --> 00:00:16.584
She just said: I’m not her.

00:00:16.634 --> 00:00:19.757
Three: never leave without helping to clear the table.

00:00:19.807 --> 00:00:24.518
And most important: as you leave, tell her one precise thing you liked about her.

00:00:24.568 --> 00:00:28.044
We forget the guest who ate well. Never the one who noticed.

00:00:28.802 --> 00:00:30.741
Want to be seen differently?

00:00:30.791 --> 00:00:33.796
My rules and my test are in a free booklet.

00:00:33.846 --> 00:00:36.567
Comment REGARD and I’ll send it to you.

00:00:36.617 --> 00:00:40.332
Or go straight to my site. The link is on my profile.
